.TH "ARC-BACKENDS" "1" "2026-09-27" "arc-cli" "Arc Manual"
.SH "NAME"
arc\-backends \- inspect native backend capabilities
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
arc backends [OPTIONS]
.PP
arcbe ...
.PP
arc\-backends ...
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Report configured backend preference order, installed binaries, and the typed capability profile Arc uses for planning rather than assuming similarly named native tools are interchangeable.
.SH "OPTIONS"
\-\-json[=legacy|v1]
.PP
\-\-verbose
.PP
\-\-remote NAME
.SH "EXAMPLES"
arc backends
.PP
arc backends \-\-remote tablet
.SH "SEE ALSO"
arc\-backends(7), arc\-formats(7)
